{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attuned is a cooperative Action Roguelike inspired by your favourite MMOs. Play with friends or unlock NPC-companions to form a 4 player party of tank, healer and DPS. Gain spells and items, maneuver enemy groups, kill bosses, chase loot but manage your risk or you might die and lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/2d18e761870ad57a81139b4cf7234e0c.poster.avif?t=1759314550\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/2d18e761870ad57a81139b4cf7234e0c.webm?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/2d18e761870ad57a81139b4cf7234e0c.mp4?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MMO-Dungeon experience without the long grind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience what we all love about dungeons. Tab target your way through packs of Elite enemies. Learn their strengths and weaknesses and excel in your role as the party's tank, healer or DPS. Defeat bosses or get wiped to try another time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/fd9c43d5858f1c8d60795d8237826bd1.poster.avif?t=1759314550\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/fd9c43d5858f1c8d60795d8237826bd1.webm?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/fd9c43d5858f1c8d60795d8237826bd1.mp4?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice matters. Loot is versatile and is shared among your party members. Focus on your favourite spells and boons or try new builds. The enemy is getting more powerful and so are you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Creation and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters right from the beginning. Looks matter, after all. Unlock and choose talents between runs. Make each character yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/0b90c81d9fa800799e2fae7cb9e425be.poster.avif?t=1759314550\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/0b90c81d9fa800799e2fae7cb9e425be.webm?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/0b90c81d9fa800799e2fae7cb9e425be.mp4?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperative Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab up to 3 friends or give your unique NPC-companions a chance to shine. You'll need all your party's ressources to progress deeper into the dungeon. Don't let your healer go out of Mana.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MMO-Dungeon-inspired gameplay focused on cooperation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with friends or offline with NPC-Companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized dungeon with changing layouts &amp; loot and multiple stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different classes to play in each role (Tank, DPS, Heal)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization &amp; progression</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877230?t=1759314550","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877230?t=1759314550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/1c42a4424eec7e79b28e005eaad526a313e47e94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759314550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/1c42a4424eec7e79b28e005eaad526a313e47e94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759314550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attuned is a cooperative Action Roguelike inspired by your favourite MMOs. Play with friends or unlock NPC-companions to form a 4 player party of tank, healer and DPS. Gain spells and items, maneuver enemy groups, kill bosses, chase loot but manage your risk or you might die and lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/2d18e761870ad57a81139b4cf7234e0c.poster.avif?t=1759314550\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/2d18e761870ad57a81139b4cf7234e0c.webm?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/2d18e761870ad57a81139b4cf7234e0c.mp4?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MMO-Dungeon experience without the long grind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience what we all love about dungeons. Tab target your way through packs of Elite enemies. Learn their strengths and weaknesses and excel in your role as the party's tank, healer or DPS. Defeat bosses or get wiped to try another time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/fd9c43d5858f1c8d60795d8237826bd1.poster.avif?t=1759314550\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/fd9c43d5858f1c8d60795d8237826bd1.webm?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/fd9c43d5858f1c8d60795d8237826bd1.mp4?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice matters. Loot is versatile and is shared among your party members. Focus on your favourite spells and boons or try new builds. The enemy is getting more powerful and so are you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Creation and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters right from the beginning. Looks matter, after all. Unlock and choose talents between runs. Make each character yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/0b90c81d9fa800799e2fae7cb9e425be.poster.avif?t=1759314550\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/0b90c81d9fa800799e2fae7cb9e425be.webm?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/extras/0b90c81d9fa800799e2fae7cb9e425be.mp4?t=1759314550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperative Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab up to 3 friends or give your unique NPC-companions a chance to shine. You'll need all your party's ressources to progress deeper into the dungeon. Don't let your healer go out of Mana.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MMO-Dungeon-inspired gameplay focused on cooperation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with friends or offline with NPC-Companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized dungeon with changing layouts &amp; loot and multiple stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different classes to play in each role (Tank, DPS, Heal)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization &amp; progression</p></li></ul>","developers":["FIRECHICK"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877230/4f16ea46c5f54d1877d464c4a8c1501180d89eba/header.jpg?t=1759314550","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3877230/1752329875/e327c52f590d74f18c033c55152bdd24f0478141/1755189127/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755194169","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3877